      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e0809e6a-170f-48d9-918b-73744f95ac62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<strong>Bullet hell</strong>, also known as &quot;<strong>danmaku</strong>&quot; (Japanese for &quot;barrage&quot; or &quot;curtain fire&quot;), is an <a href=\"#/arcade\">arcade</a> <a href=\"#/genre\">subgenre</a> of <a href=\"#/shooter\">shoot 'em up</a> video games characterized by an overwhelming number of projectiles or &quot;bullets&quot; on screen. These games require players to navigate their <a href=\"#/avatar\">avatar</a> through intricate <a href=\"#/pattern\">patterns</a> of enemy fire, demanding a high level of spatial awareness, reflexes, and <a href=\"#/strategy\">strategic</a> play. Bullet hell games are often considered a test of <a href=\"#/skill\">skill</a> and endurance, offering a unique and <a href=\"#/ilinx\">exhilarating</a> play experience for those who enjoy fast-paced <a href=\"#/action\">action</a> and intense <a href=\"#/difficulty\">challenges</a>."
    },
    {
      "id": "6800cb5c-f5e4-4e56-a8c7-56645abfe22b",
      "type": "columns",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "6e5fc085-5680-48d5-ad54-bab0599201b5",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "d01327ee-71fe-4f6d-bd55-dce97c985c7d",
              "type": "image",
              "src": "./assets/images/untitled-7a8f577fbd60.webp",
              "caption": "a rendering <a href=\"#/glitch\">glitch</a> in <em>Mushihimesama</em> for Steam, emphasizing the already dense bullet patterns",
              "alt": "Untitled"
            },
            {
              "id": "0467154e-fc47-491c-8cc6-a3a562cfd5cc",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8d41896f-4edb-4789-85dd-fe2bf4e79b71",
          "type": "column",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "cf6eb93e-bad1-4e50-b1f9-e8bc3021f837",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "In bullet hell games, players are not only challenged by the sheer volume of projectiles but also by the complexity of their patterns and behaviors. This creates a dynamic and engaging play environment where players must constantly adapt to new situations and think critically about their <a href=\"#/the-primacy-of-movement\">movements</a>. The aesthetic qualities of bullet hell games, with their colorful and mesmerizing projectile patterns, contribute to a sense of playful immersion in a <a href=\"#/chaos\">chaotic</a> and thrilling world. Mastery of bullet hell <a href=\"#/gameplay\">gameplay</a> often becomes a source of pride and accomplishment, as players share their successes and strategies on global score leaderboards and post “1 credit clears” wherein they beat the game without using any continues."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
